.el .ds Aq '
.TH FATHOM_DAEMON_STOP 1  "fathom 0.1.0-alpha.1" 
.SH NAME
fathom\-daemon\-stop \- Ask the daemon to finish its pass, checkpoint and release the lease
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBfathom daemon stop\fR [\fB\-\-root\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-socket\fR] [\fB\-\-reason\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Ask the daemon to finish its pass, checkpoint and release the lease
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-root\fR \fI<ROOT>\fR [default: .]
The repository whose daemon to stop
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print the outcome as one JSON line (`fathom.cli.daemon.stop/1`)
.TP
\fB\-\-socket\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Ask the daemon at this endpoint instead of the derived one
.TP
\fB\-\-reason\fR \fI<REASON>\fR [default: fathom daemon stop]
Who is asking, recorded in the daemon\*(Aqs last line
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
